    "title": "Eckert powers No. 16 Bayonne past Memorial - Baseball recap - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Advance Local Express Desk Reed Becker ,\n2 days ago Luke Eckert hit a home run and drove in three runs to lead Bayonne, No. 16 in the NJ.com Top 20, to a 6-3 victory over Memorial in West New York. Jack Kelly struck out eight batters while allowing three runs on six hits over six innings to earn the win for Bayonne (12-2), which has won two consecutive games. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
